:: MP Daily Robin 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深后的孤儿院卧室只亮着床头小灯，<<else>>安静的孤儿院双人卧室里，<</if>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>正把新织好的蓝灰毛线护腕摆在木匣里，旁边搁着一团备用绒线与竹针：「天凉的时候戴上它，干活就不会冻着手腕了。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[回罗宾身边 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回罗宾身边 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_robin_10 is 1>>
蓝灰毛线护腕已贴身戴好，腕间满是<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>一针一线的暖意。
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去下一处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-robin-10">
<<investigateicon>><<link "试戴护腕 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-10">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 400>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_10 to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 2>><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_robin_10_rew")>><<money 380>>罗宾开心地替你理平护腕折边，把本周热可可摊攒下的分红塞进你手心。<<else>>细密绒线贴合着手腕，罗宾握着你的手掌贴在自己脸颊边。<</if>><span class="green">罗宾纯挚的关怀驱散了你一身的寒意。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你抬手太急，衣袖挂住了护腕边缘的收口线头。<span class="red"><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>忙按住你的手腕替你轻轻解开。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[矮身再试戴护腕 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<caveicon "torch">><<link "收好绒线尾结 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-10">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 230>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_10 to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_robin_10_knit"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_robin_10_knit"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 2>><</if>><<trauma -1>><<ltrauma>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_robin_10_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>线头收得平整隐蔽，罗宾惊喜地抱住你的肩膀，分给你一袋手织平安绒结。<<else>>两副护腕并排收进木匣，你们肩并肩靠在床沿低语。<</if>><span class="green">默契的手工配合让卧室里暖意融融。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	竹针尖端略滑，收尾时线环松了半扣。<span class="red"><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>手把手带着你挑紧线环。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[敛息再收好尾结 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Daily Robin 11 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>窗外细雨敲打着孤儿院阁楼天窗，<<else>>孤儿院阁楼储物间透进温和天光，<</if>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>正蹲在木箱前整理要送往集市寄卖的手工木偶，箱角放着一瓶清漆与一叠彩纸价签：「有你在旁边帮忙，我心里一下子就踏实了。」
<<if $mpClues["clue_robin_10_knit"]>><span class="teal">戴着昨晚一起收尾的蓝灰毛线护腕，你搬动木箱时手腕既保暖又利索。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[回罗宾身边 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回罗宾身边 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_robin_11 is 1>>
寄卖木偶已全部装匣贴妥，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>脸上洋溢着安心的笑意。
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-robin-11">
<<investigateicon>><<link "给木偶上清漆 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-11">>
<<if (($tending or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_robin_10_knit'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_11 to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 2>><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_robin_11_rew")>><<money 420>>木偶表面泛起温润光泽，罗宾把寄卖预支的定金分了一半装进你口袋。<<else>>清漆干透后木纹清晰，罗宾靠在你身旁一一定好编号。<</if>><span class="green">你们合力备妥了整箱寄卖木偶。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	漆刷蘸得稍多，木偶底座边缘挂了一滴清漆珠。<span class="red"><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>递来干布帮你轻轻拭平。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[压手再给木清漆 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link "写好寄卖价签 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-11">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_11 to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 2>><</if>><<trauma -1>><<ltrauma>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_robin_11_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>端秀字迹令木偶更显精致，罗宾欢喜地亲了下你的脸颊，塞给你一枚手绘木书签。<<else>>彩纸价签整整齐齐系在木偶腕上，阁楼里满是欢声笑语。<</if>><span class="green">井井有条的账目与价签让寄卖万无一失。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">继续同行 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	阁楼木板微晃，钢笔尖在彩纸角划出了一道浅印。<span class="red"><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>替你按稳木板桌面。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[沉肩再写好价签 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Daily Eden 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜风吹拂着林间木屋的松木屋檐，<<else>>林间木屋的壁炉里柴火哔剥作响，<</if>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>林间猎人<</if>>正坐在长条木凳上用油石打磨猎刀，桌边放着一罐蜂蜡膏与一捆新鞣好的鹿皮条：「过来坐，把你常穿的那双靴子拿来我看看。」
