	木桶边沿磕在石阶上，几块木炭滚落到脚边。<span class="red"><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>林间猎人<</if>>伸手扶稳木桶。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
